{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《中年好聲音》第一季冠軍周吉成為首位正式獲邀參與大型內地官方節目錄影參賽者。他以香港代表身份前往廣西出席「第8 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《中年好聲音》第一季冠軍周吉成為首位正式獲邀參與大型內地官方節目錄影參賽者。他以香港代表身份前往廣西出席「第8屆東盟視聽周開幕禮」，聯同《中國好聲音》總冠軍伍珂玥同台獻唱多首經典廣東歌。\n</p>\n<h2>周吉佩首戰內地大型節目合唱粵語金曲</h2>\n<p>昨日周吉佩遠赴廣西出席「第8屆東盟視聽周開幕禮」，這是他演藝生涯中首次參與內地主流節目錄影。同場匯聚了來自內地各省份以及東盟國家優秀歌手，場面非常盛大。全晚高潮在於他與《中國好聲音》總冠軍伍珂玥同台亮相，兩人攜手合唱多首膾炙人口經典粵語金曲，傾力向各地觀眾推廣粵語音樂文化。</p>\n<h2>周吉佩大讚北海銀灘濃郁廣東話文化氛圍</h2>\n<p>留在廣西北海期間，周吉佩深深體會到當地濃厚方言氣氛。他親自表示：「廣西有近2500萬人講粵語，同廣東粵語非常相似。不論是搭乘的士、在餐廳用餐，還是與當地民眾交流，隨處都能聽到大家唱著、聽著香港的廣東歌。」他更特意前往著名景點銀灘打卡，補充指當地民眾深受香港電影及電視劇薰陶，對廣東歌抱有極深情懷。\n</p>\n<h2>《中年好聲音》首位獲邀選手創下演藝里程碑</h2>\n<p>自從奪冠後周吉佩一直努力發展歌唱事業。這次他成為《中年好聲音》首位正式獲邀參與大型內地官方節目錄影參賽者，絕對是其演藝生涯一大突破。獲委以香港代表歌手重任，他不僅展現出個人歌唱實力，更肩負起將本土流行音樂帶到更遠舞台使命，讓更多不同地區人士認識香港樂壇獨有魅力。</p>\n<h2>夥《中國好聲音》總冠軍同台演出贏盡掌聲</h2>\n<p>這場精心編排粵語金曲串燒表演不僅在現場贏得熱烈掌聲，網上亦掀起一陣廣東歌熱潮。在台下與各地歌手互動交流時，周吉佩獲得極高評價。他滿懷自豪地透露這趟旅程中聽到最多讚美說話就是：「你的粵語好好聽！」大批網民被中港冠軍同台合唱畫面震撼，紛紛表達對廣東歌獨特氛圍喜愛，對這位香港代表演出給予高度肯定。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273009897964270_10972349606adae3f6dc6d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"katchau86_1792569257_4012670964441020962_10526911.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273009897964270_10972349606adae3f6dc6d3.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周吉佩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927301068777844_1636184166adae3fc48d06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"katchau86_1792569257_4012670964600299627_10526911.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927301068777844_1636184166adae3fc48d06.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周吉佩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273011026687589_20518452166adae40015b56.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"katchau86_1792569257_4012670963711088977_10526911.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273011026687589_20518452166adae40015b56.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周吉佩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273011961691047_7780256796adae408b972c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"katchau86_1792569257_4012670963996407790_10526911.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273011961691047_7780256796adae408b972c.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周吉佩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273012418650929_683113456adae40de1758.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"katchau86_1792569257_4012670956748548531_10526911.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273012418650929_683113456adae40de1758.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周吉佩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%ad%e5%b9%b4%e5%a5%bd%e8%81%b2%e9%9f%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中年好聲音</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%a8%e5%90%89%e4%bd%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">周吉佩</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e7%9b%9f%e8%a6%96%e8%81%bd%e5%91%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東盟視聽周</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3528651\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:54:59.992967+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1175,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:35:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:28.750132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:32.168118+00:00","content_hash":"dc539b486660dc169fa43469100bedc8bb76ba5142c5059e83191e44416be470","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}